    q: 'What happens if I cannot find a job before the moratorium ends?',
    a: 'This is the real risk behind a large education loan, and it is worth planning for before you sign, not after. Ask your lender directly about grace-period extension options and restructuring policies before you need them. Practically, protect yourself by keeping a second, portable skill and an active job search running in more than one market during your final study year, so a slow hiring cycle in your first-choice country does not leave you with no income right as principal repayment begins.',
  },
];

const jsonLd = [
